{"id": "t033-001", "text": "Lwazi's knee surgery is booked for June 3rd. He sounded fine about it but his wife says he hasn't been sleeping.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "hasn't been sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t033-005", "text": "Chat with Oscar after the client call. Their new account director, Teresa, wants everything in writing from now on. He thinks she's going to be hard work. The renewal is due sometime in early December and Krisztina is already panicking about the pricing. We agreed to put together a one-page summary for Teresa by November 8th, and Oscar will take the first pass at it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the client call"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "account director", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants everything in writing", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from now on"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "renewal", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Krisztina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Teresa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by November 8th"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t033-006", "text": "Fatima had her gallbladder out on Monday. Home now but still very sore. I should drop round some soup sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had her gallbladder out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sore", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop round some soup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t033-008", "text": "Note to self: dentist moved to 11/12 at 9:15. Need to ask for the morning off.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 11/12 at 9:15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask for the morning off", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t033-009", "text": "Zhang has been made team lead. Officially starts January 6th, once Marcus moves over to the Singapore office.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zhang", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made team lead", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "January 6th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marcus", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves over to the Singapore office", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t033-010", "text": "Alina's dog Biscuit had to have a tumour removed. She was in bits on the phone this morning. Vet says he should be fine but they're waiting on the biopsy results, probably sometime next week. Don't forget to message her on Friday to see if they've heard anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "have a tumour removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in bits", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t033-012", "text": "Isabel's father is in the Royal Infirmary with pneumonia. She's flying up to Glasgow tonight and won't be back until at least the 20th. Her brother Sam is driving up from Bristol to join her. She asked me to keep an eye on her inbox and push back the Schmidt review, which I've done. Remind me to text her on Sunday to see how her dad is doing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "father", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in the Royal Infirmary", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying up to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until at least the 20th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up from Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t033-023", "text": "Eilidh and Isla got engaged on holiday in Portugal! Wedding probably over the summer next year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isla", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "holiday in Portugal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer next year", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t033-024", "text": "Spoke to Julia about the reorg. Her manager is being made redundant and she's worried she's next. There's a consultation meeting sometime next week. She's been with the company eleven years and has a mortgage to think about, so she's understandably rattled. I said I'd look over her CV with her. Need to set aside an evening for that before the meeting, maybe Monday or Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "reorg", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "consultation meeting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "with the company eleven years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a mortgage", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "rattled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "set aside an evening for that", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the meeting", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday or Tuesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t033-026", "text": "Reggie had his hernia operation yesterday and is already complaining about the hospital food, so he must be feeling better. He's off work for six weeks and his boss is not happy about it. Remind me to call him at the weekend, and maybe take round the crossword books he likes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reggie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hernia operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "better", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not happy", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take round the crossword books he likes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crossword books", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t033-029", "text": "Sam's grandad passed away on Saturday. The funeral is on the 31st. Need to send a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 31st", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t033-032", "text": "Met Mr Petrov's daughter, Natasha, at the hospital. Her dad's recovery from the bypass is going slower than expected. They're hoping he can go home by the end of the month. Natasha has been staying at his flat to look after his parrot, Kiki, and travelling in every day. She looked exhausted. I gave her my number in case she needs a lift or anything at all.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mr Petrov", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recovery from the bypass", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "go home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "parrot, Kiki", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every day"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t033-037", "text": "Fatima's son Andile has his driving test on August 2nd. Third attempt, and she says he's a nervous wreck. He failed the last one on a roundabout and has been practising with his uncle every evening since. Fatima is trying not to make a fuss. I should text him good luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous wreck", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening since"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fatima", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text him good luck", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t033-039", "text": "Isabel's dad is out of hospital. She's back at work on Monday but will be working from home for a bit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "out of hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a bit"}]}
{"id": "t033-041", "text": "Ines had a scare at her twelve-week scan but everything looks fine now. Next appointment is around the middle of next month. I really ought to send her something small, maybe the baby book she mentioned.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ines", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twelve-week scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Next appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "around the middle of next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her something small", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "baby book", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t033-043", "text": "Akira's annual review got pushed to sometime in December. He's relieved, honestly.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "annual review", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to sometime in December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relieved", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t033-046", "text": "Alina says Biscuit's biopsy came back clear. Huge relief.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Huge relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t033-050", "text": "Lunch with Ioana. Her company is being bought out and everyone is anxious. Her boss told them nothing will change, which nobody believes. The deal is supposed to close at the end of the quarter, probably around December 15th. I should check in with her after the announcement, and maybe introduce her to Elif, whose firm went through the same thing last year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bought out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the quarter", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "around December 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "announcement", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "introduce her to Elif", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}]}
{"id": "t033-053", "text": "Eilidh has a hospital appointment on 5/2 about her migraines. She's had them for years and is fed up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eilidh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hospital appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "5/2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "migraines", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t033-057", "text": "Remember to cancel the gym membership before it renews on 11/1.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "cancel the gym membership", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "renews", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/1", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t033-059", "text": "James's wife, Adriana, has just been signed off work for stress. He said she's been struggling since the summer. I need to ask him how she's doing next time we talk, without making a big thing of it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "James", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "signed off work", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stress", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the summer"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how she's doing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next time we talk", "anchor": "a1"}]}
